flowchart LR
    A[冻结原厂与上一版基线] --> B[从日志或 dump 选一个确定故障]
    B --> C[修改一个主要变量]
    C --> D[编译 Image 与受影响模块]
    D --> E[ABI / 签名 / DTB / boot 结构门禁]
    E --> F["fastboot boot<br/>只进 RAM"]
    F --> G{Android 上线?}
    G -- 是 --> H[dmesg / logcat / 功能实测]
    G -- "否, 900e" --> I[先保存 Sahara crashdump]
    H --> J[记录通过项与下一故障]
    I --> J
    J --> K[强制重启回原厂分区内核]
    K --> B

    classDef safe fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#f59f00,color:#343a40;
    classDef evidence fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#343a40;
    classDef pass fill:#d3f9d8,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#343a40;
    class F,K safe;
    class B,H,I evidence;
    class J pass;
